BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261109-19@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261108T060424Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261109T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261109T210000
SUMMARY:Jeff Harnar -  I KNOW THINGS NOW: My Life in Sondheim’s Words
LOCATION:Birdland Jazz Club\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Music Director: Jon WeberBass: Steve DoyleDrums: Ray MarchicaDi
 
rected by: Sondra Lee Jeff Harnar returns to Birdland with his BroadwayWorl
 
d Award-winning show\, I Know Things Now: My Life in Sondheims Words\, on M
 
onday\, November 9 at 7pm. Drawing from the words and music of Stephen Sond
 
heim\, Harnar creates a deeply personal self-portrait of the emotional land
 
scape of an openly gay New Yorker. Joined by renowned jazz pianist and musi
 
c director Jon Weber\, with Steve Doyle on bass and Ray Marchica on drums\,
 
 Harnar explores an eclectic collection of songs from Follies\, Into the Wo
 
ods\, A Little Night Music\, Road Show\, Dick Tracy\, Passion\, Company and
 
 more. With a gender-bending fluidity\, Harnar brings his own perspective t
 
o Sondheims work\, including many songs originally introduced by women. The
 
 show received Stephen Sondheims personal endorsement and was recorded by P
 
S Classics as a MAC Award-winning album. I Know Things Now was directed by 
 
Broadway legend Sondra Lee\, who originated the role of Tiger Lily opposite
 
 Mary Martin in Peter Pan and Minnie Fay opposite Carol Channing in Hello\,
 
 Dolly! This special encore performance is dedicated to Lees memory followi
 
ng her passing in February 2026. Ingenious singularly special. The New York
 
 Sun A thing of wonder\, a show of powerful storytelling unforgettable\, im
 
peccable and completely original. BroadwayWorld Tickets & info: https://www
 
.ticketweb.com/event/jeff-harnar-birdland-jazz-club-tickets/14282094
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/jeff-harnar-birdland-jazz-club-tickets/
 
14282094
END:VEVENT
